<h1>About Learning System</h1>
<section><h2>Our mission</h2><p>Support independent learning for pre-university and foundation students through courses in multiple subjects, varied teaching materials and interactive practice.</p></section>
<section><h2>Our objectives</h2><ul><li>Organise learning into clear courses, topics and lessons.</li><li>Let learners study at their own pace and see their progress.</li><li>Help teachers create learning materials and activities.</li><li>Support practice through quizzes, reflection, discussion, games and scenarios.</li></ul></section>
<section><h2>How it works</h2><p>Browse published courses and free previews. Register as a learner, enrol in a course and study its lessons. Mark lessons complete to update your progress. Teachers apply for an account, receive administrator approval and build their own courses.</p><p><a href="Courses.aspx">Find a course</a> · <a href="Help.aspx">Read the help guide</a></p></section>
